  "name": "Scadeald stallions from Remount Master Edward show their horse models when mounted",
  "contract": [
    "Remount Master Edward (164592) sells the Scadeald stallions. Spells 365257-365267 (except Grey 365260) and",
    "365200-365210 apply SPELL_AURA_MOUNTED with creatures 379992-380002 and 267700-267710 and a mounted speed aura.",
    "CreatureDisplayInfo.dbc gives each spell's coat: 141899-141909 on ridinghorsescadeald.m2 and 141910-141920 on",
    "pvpridinghorsescadeald.m2; creature cache captures confirm 141904, 141909 and 141918-141920.",
    "Each mount must set the rider's mount display to its coat; display 0 is the reported invisible mount. Item 560267",
    "proves the vendor item path once; the other mounts are learned as fixtures. This reads the server's mount display,",
    "not the rendered client model."
  ],
